        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9047, Ultima IV Mitered Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9047 Ultima IV Mitered Cabinet Door Pull is forged from solid brass. The sleek look of the mitered pull pairs perfectly with a contemporary or modern design.  Available in your choice of unlaquered brass, satin brass, antique brass, oil-rubbed bronze, polished chrome, and satin nickel finishes in 6 lengths ranging from 4 inches to 18 inches.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSince this simple cabinet pull is so easy to clean it will maintain a smooth, rich luster for the lifetime of your home; and just like all Omnia's brass cabinet pulls, the 9047 is worthy of the exceptional standards that Omnia has embraced for more than 40 years.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/ultima-iv-mitered-appliance-handle-omnia-ap-9047p-1250170\"><b>Matching Ultima IV Mitered Refrigerator Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 Lengths:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9047/102:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9047/153:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9047/203:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9047/254:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9047/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9047/457:</b>\r\n